### create team 
POST http://localhost:3000/api/teams
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VySWQiOjEsImlhdCI6MTc4NDk4NzA0OSwiZXhwIjoxNzg0OTg3NjQ5fQ.9xdyvOEZZjy-opedT88ZlKABuAynixaX-2h7xrLZPW8
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "teamName": "test",
    "description": "this team is to test the code"
}

